  "description": "A tiny service locator so you don't hand-store every UseXxx() instance. Register each once (hub.Add(server.UseInventory()), …) and resolve it anywhere by type (Service.Get<InventoryServer>()), via an ambient hub (MakeCurrent) or a per-server/per-client hub (server.Services()). Lets brains, handlers and helpers reach loco/ticks/dialogue/chat/… without constructor plumbing. Depends only on SetNet.",
